# Optional path to gphoto2 for Canon USB tethering. By default the app finds
# `gphoto2` on PATH. Install it on the same computer as the camera and app.
# macOS (Homebrew): brew install gphoto2
# Ubuntu / Debian: sudo apt install gphoto2
# GPHOTO2_PATH=/opt/homebrew/bin/gphoto2

# Optional folder for local photos, settings, and Gmail credentials.
# PHOTO_KIOSK_DATA_DIR=.data

# Optional Python executable for the native Portrait GPU runtime. By default,
# the app uses .venv-ai/bin/python created by `npm run setup:ai` on this machine.
# PHOTO_KIOSK_AI_PYTHON=/absolute/path/to/venv/bin/python
